{
  "name": "dsh-dapusa",
  "version": "0.8.1",
  "description": "大菩萨实证法义 — 依圣光临在开示取法：左侧栏「学法 / 实修 / 问小光」页面；浮在界面上的小光（精灵形象）随机念一句短法义（间隔可设）；另外提供桌面浮窗版小光（macOS 原生窗口 / Windows PowerShell 原生窗口）——浮在所有窗口最上层，DSH 最小化后仍显示；内置记忆智能体小光（人格与记忆随包），法义问答逐字引用原文并附《篇名》日期；对话中另有 practice_ask / xiaoguang_ask / xiaoguang_desktop 工具。原文一字不改，不判定境界。",
  "type": "module",
  "icon": "./icon.webp",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.webp"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "engine.js",
    "client.js",
    "data/*.json",
    "memory/**",
    "xiaoguang.js",
    "native/**",
    "desktop-float.js",
    "skills/**",
    "locale/*.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "icon.webp",
    "assets/**"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ]
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "cordis",
    "plugin",
    "dharma",
    "buddhism"
  ],
  "license": "MIT"
}
